message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "Solar Sail Race 谁谓河广"
abstract: >-
  A non-real-time racing game about solar sails and electric sails. The player
  picks a sail and its attitude control mechanisms, steers between gravity and
  light pressure or the stellar wind to reach target orbits or race out of a
  field of many stars, and every run is scored by deterministic re-simulation
  of its replay.
type: software
